      "writtenOn": "2024-12-11T10:00:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The usage in `libnfsidmap` was only when Ganesha was configured to use Kerberos + Directory Services, I don\u0027t think that there are many users that have that kind of setup, it isn\u0027t even documented anywhere properly and took us quite a while to find the exact way to have it configured properly to work",
      "parentUuid": "9b48de0d_ee9901de",
      "revId": "a1c31249ac9f3bf3a5d8af6eee51885535156ce2",
